PA_Server_Side_Engagement PageNumber batch — push_adv_prf Individual Records (20 rows per page, Source = Push Advice, validated = Yes). Update PageNumber and TotalPages on the DE; CloudPage uses URL contactPage= and LookupRows(Source, validated, PageNumber).

SELECT
    UniqueKey,
    CAST(((ROW_NUMBER() OVER (
        PARTITION BY Source
        ORDER BY LastSent DESC, Contact_Id, JobID, UniqueKey
    ) - 1) / 20) + 1 AS INT) AS PageNumber,
    CAST(((COUNT(1) OVER (
        PARTITION BY Source
    ) - 1) / 20) + 1 AS INT) AS TotalPages
FROM PA_Server_Side_Engagement
WHERE Source = 'Push Advice'
  AND LTRIM(RTRIM(ISNULL(validated, ''))) = 'Yes'

Download (push_adv_prf + Performance): Download button uses export=csv on the same CloudPage. Server loops PageNumber 1..TotalPages (same LookupRows as the table). Table search/filter is not applied to CSV; use client download only when a filter is active on the current loaded rows.
